## Relief requested

I respectfully request that the Attorney General (and/or the California
Privacy Protection Agency where applicable) investigate {{ broker.name }}
for noncompliance with the cited statute(s), including but not limited to:

1. Failure to delete personal information within the statutory time frame;
2. Failure to honor opt-out of sale/sharing;
3. Where applicable, failure to honor a Delete Act bulk-deletion request
   propagated via the CalPrivacy DROP registry on a 45-day cadence
   (Cal. Civ. Code §§1798.99.80–1798.99.89).

